>Pin</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2330\" data-col-size=\"md\">4500mAh, sạc nhanh 25W, sạc không dây, sạc ngược</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2404\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2352\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kháng nước</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2404\" data-col-size=\"md\">IP68</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2426\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kết nối</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2478\" data-col-size=\"md\">5G, Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.3, NFC</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2552\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2500\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Hệ điều hành</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2552\" data-col-size=\"md\">Android 14 với One UI 6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2574\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Âm thanh</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2626\" data-col-size=\"md\">Loa stereo, Dolby Atmos</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2700\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2648\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bảo mật</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2700\" data-col-size=\"md\">Vân tay dưới màn hình, nhận diện khuôn mặt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2774\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2722\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Trọng lượng</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2774\">202g</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2848\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2796\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Chất liệu</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2848\">Khung nhôm, kính Gorilla Glass Victus 2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\"></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2968\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-start=\"2925\" data-e